  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With cash in hand, Muranishi and Toshi sit down at a Sapporo coffee shop to meet a magazine broker named Chu. After hearing about the biggest publisher in Japan, Muranishi surprises everyone at the table with the size of his order. Listen to the conversation in Japanese first, and don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "ああ、トシさん、どうも。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "カバン屋のチュウさんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうも、村西です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "はい。どれでもあるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "あとはポセイドンさんのシリーズだね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ポセイドン？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "業界じゃ最大手だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、いただこうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "どれがご入り用だい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "全種類です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんなたくさんいらないだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まさか、店でも構えるつもりか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watch how Muranishi stays calm and polite even while making a bold move that catches Toshi off guard. Let's go through it line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "カバン屋のチュウさんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Chu, the bag dealer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうも、村西です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, I am Muranishi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "どれでもあるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have whatever you want.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "業界じゃ最大手だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are the biggest player in the industry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、いただこうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, I will take them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "どれがご入り用だい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which ones do you need?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "全種類です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every kind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんなたくさんいらないだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not need that many, do you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まさか、店でも構えるつもりか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, are you planning to open a shop or something?'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
